the concentration step: max sum of tur(n_i) over t parts summing to u
   checked every 1 <= t <= u <= 32: the maximum is always tur(u - t + 1)

the excess budget X = 2m - 1624 at the three rows:
   m = 838: X = 52
   m = 839: X = 54
   m = 840: X = 56
   so X <= 56, as the inequality assumes

the lower side, symbolically checked at sample points (|R|, u, X, w outside U):
   |R| = 28, u = 10, X = 56, w outside U = True: 29u - (X - (|R| - u)) = 276, stated bound 276 -> identical
   |R| = 24, u = 6, X = 52, w outside U = False: 29u - (X - (|R| - u)) = 140, stated bound 140 -> identical
   |R| = 32, u = 20, X = 56, w outside U = True: 29u - (X - (|R| - u)) = 560, stated bound 560 -> identical
